@baseUrl = https://tpi-hospital-api-e9hkdnhycfh2bxa3.centralus-01.azurewebsites.net/api

### 1. Create Patient (No Auth Required for Test Endpoint or Staff Auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/create-patient
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "dni": "12345678",
  "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
  "phoneNumber": "555-1234",
  "address": "123 Main St"
}

### 2. Create Doctor
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/create-doctor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dr. Smith",
  "email": "dr.smith@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "credential": "MED123",
  "specialty": "Cardiology"
}

### 3. Create Receptionist
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/create-receptionist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rec. Alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "employeeNumber": "EMP123",
  "workingShift": "Morning",
  "area": "Front Desk"
}

### 4. Login (Doctor) -> Replace token in env manually for subsequent requests
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dr.smith@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Set token variable (requires manual assignment in some REST clients or uses the extracted one below)
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 5. Get All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/User
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get User By ID (Replace {id} with a real ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/User/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Delete User (Replace {id})
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/User/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get All Rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/Room
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Create Appointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/Appointment/create-appointment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "patientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "doctorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "roomId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "dateTime": "2026-07-01T10:00:00Z"
}

### 10. Cancel Appointment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Appointment/cancel-appointment/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Complete Appointment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Appointment/complete-appointment/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Get Patient Appointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/Appointment/patient-appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Create Medical History
POST {{baseUrl}}/MedicalHistory
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "appointmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "diagnostic": "Patient is recovering well."
}

### 14. Get Medical History for Patient
GET {{baseUrl}}/MedicalHistory/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
